 "build": {
  "id": "1f452ce9-dda8-464c-8e84-8fbb176b29eb",
  "title": "Witcher - Witch Hunter BK",
  "description": "[overview]\nSolo build focused on surviving most encounters and being able to farm multiple mobs at once with ease\n\n[talents]\nClass spec: Combat Training 2/2 ->Night Stalker 2/2 -> Brimming Hatred -> Evil Never Sleeps -> Witchblood Tonic -> Follow the Edict -> Vengeful Intent -> Brand the unworthy -> Dark intuition ->Vampire Hunter. \nRest is up to liking\n\n\nBK spec: first focus on getting March of the Black King for proccing Shadow Brand with it, then unlock desecrate for multiple mob farm -> wide swings into Witchblight->Noctis Protection-> Dark Juggernaut\n\n[rotation]\nEarly levels focus on attacking enemies with ranged then transition into melee combat\nUse Noctis Blade whenever possible\nDesecrate only when fighting more enemies\nBurrow bolt to get caster into melee range\n\n[stats]\nAgility is most important then focus on spellpower, due to level 30 passive you should have enough Stamina to survive\n\n[gear]\nI recommend crafting your gear with leatherworking since its pretty decent\n\n[enchants]\nAgility Elixir and Defense since lower armor \nScroll of Agility or Protection",
